    "describe_ch": "本課程利用App inventor 2，讓學生了解行動裝置程式設計的概念。課程將利用數個App的實作以引起學生對程式語言的興趣。最終學生將有能力設計、建構，以及公開發布他們獨創之應用Apps.",
    "describe_eh": "By adopting App inventor 2 as the platform, the course aims to instruct students the concepts of mobile device programming.  This course uses the implementations of several Apps to arise students' interest in programming.  Finally, students are able to design, build, and publish their innovative Apps.",
